#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:10
msgid "## v1 Implemented"
msgstr "## v1 已实现"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:17
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability | Description |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------- |\n"
#| "| `memory_recall` | Four sources: semantic / session / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; session returns snippet |\n"
#| "| `sessions_search` | Session message FTS; returns snippet (not full content) |\n"
#| "| `memory_remember` | semantic_memory CRUD |\n"
#| "| Resident memory | system prompt injection (not recall) |\n"
msgid ""
"| Capability        | Description                                                                                  |\n"
"| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | Four sources: semantic / session / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; session returns snippet |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | Session message search; returns snippet (not full content)                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | Semantic memory CRUD during conversation                                                     |\n"
"| Resident memory   | System prompt injection (not recall)                                                         |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力              | 说明                                                                           |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | semantic / session / limbic / autobiographical 四源；Top N；session 为 snippet |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | 会话消息 FTS；返回 snippet（非整条 content）                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | semantic_memory CRUD                                                           |\n"
"| 常驻记忆          | system prompt 注入（非 recall）                                                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:19
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "## Threat Sources"
msgid "### Four Sources"
msgstr "## 威胁源"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `memory_type`      | Content type                          |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `semantic`         | Facts, preferences, experiences, etc. |\n"
"| `session`          | Historical conversation snippets      |\n"
"| `limbic`           | Emotional memory                      |\n"
"| `autobiographical` | Narrative title + content snippet     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Resident memory"
msgid "### Resident Memory"
msgstr "常驻记忆"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:30
msgid ""
"Separate from recall: **pinned** semantic memories plus **most-referenced** "
"entries are always injected into the system prompt. LLM cites memory ID "
"markers in replies; reference counts sync via nightly cron."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:32
msgid "## Relationship to Self Layer"
msgstr "## 与自我层的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Self layer (six blocks) is not retrieved via `recall`."
msgid ""
"Self layer (six blocks) is **not** retrieved via `memory_recall`—it is "
"always in the system prompt."
msgstr "自我层（六块）不通过 `recall` 检索。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Layer | Injection | Reason |\n"
#| "| ----- | --------- | ------ |\n"
#| "| Self layer | Always in system prompt | Small, fixed, every conversation needs \"who I am\" |\n"
#| "| Memory layer | `recall` + downstream load | Large, dynamic, search on demand |\n"
#| "| Resource layer | `recall` + downstream load | Tool definitions needed temporarily, load before call |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer        | Injection                 | Reason                                            |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Self layer   | Always in system prompt   | Small, fixed, every conversation needs \"who I am\" |\n"
"| Memory layer | `memory_recall` on demand | Large, dynamic, search when needed                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层     | 注入方式               | 理由                                   |\n"
"| ------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 自我层 | 始终注入 system prompt | 量小、固定、每次对话都需要定义\"我是谁\" |\n"
"| 记忆层 | `recall` + 下游加载    | 量大、动态、按需搜索                   |\n"
"| 资源层 | `recall` + 下游加载    | 工具定义是临时需要的，调之前才加载     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/recall-flow.md:41
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "### Future Upgrade Path"
msgid "## Future Direction"
msgstr "### 未来升级路径"

